  AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002254> "Y must already exist when X arises, so start(X) > start(Y). Allen dfOMP (starts_after) -- NOT preceded_by, since Y need not cease when X appears."@en)
